      "sourceTextSha256": "d0fbbe191ad5759928c9f6abbbeb8d4d5ea9a1c0068ab204d92e4e013a6a529b",
      "text": "Take a sightseeing tour of Lima with an English-speaking guide. Start at the Park of Love in Miraflores, with views over the Pacific Ocean. Then drive past Huaca Huallamarca, a pre-Inca administrative and religious center. Continue to the main square, home to the Presidential Palace and City Hall. Visit Lima Cathedral, or the Lima Art Museum (MALI) if the cathedral is closed. Then walk to the Convent of Santo Domingo along the narrow streets where Saint Martin de Porres and Saint Rose of Lima walked in the 17th century. Their remains are interred in churches.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw8xm7mg-7cp5ig",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
